# Line endings that must survive a Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true is the Windows default).
# The patches are applied with `git apply` to an LF export of Codex: converted to CRLF they no
# longer apply (specs/DREAMFERENCE_PUFFIN_WINDOWS_ARM.md section 16.1).
*.patch -text
# Shell scripts run by bash, which reads a CR as part of the line.
*.sh text eol=lf
# Read by PowerShell 5.1, which accepts either; CRLF is what Windows editors write.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
